{
 "nodes": [
  {
   "id": "cap-btitle",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -2900,
   "y": -760,
   "width": 1700,
   "height": 190,
   "text": "# DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813 — one decoder layer  \nL4, a ÷4 layer with its own indexer and learned routing. Grey bars = tensors (0.05 px/channel, long ones clipped; stacked = 4 mHC lanes), boxes = operations with their weights per layer. Read top → bottom; the five middle columns run side by side."
  },
  {
   "id": "cap-bnote",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -1100,
   "y": -760,
   "width": 1700,
   "height": 190,
   "text": "**Layer variants.** 31 of 61 layers compress ÷128 instead: no indexer (left two columns skipped), compressor 7168→512 without overlap (7.4M), and every block is attended. L0–2 replace the learned top-6 pick by a fixed token-id → expert table (tid2eid). Attention, MoE and mHC are otherwise identical everywhere."
  },
  {
   "id": "bh41",
