  {
   "id": "note-kv",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1210,
   "y": 579,
   "width": 520,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "Why so cheap at 1M tokens: the cache keeps one 512-dim vector per token for the last 128 tokens, one per 4 tokens (÷4 layers) or per 128 tokens (÷128 layers) beyond that, plus a 128-dim indexer key per block. Each query reads at most 128 + 1024 vectors in ÷4 layers."
  }
